    <title>Retrieval-Augmented Generation for Knowledge-Intensive
  NLP Tasks</title>
    <summary>  Large pre-trained language models have been shown to store factual
knowledge in their parameters. We explore a general-purpose fine-tuning recipe
for retrieval-augmented generation (RAG).
</summary>
